      q: "A pharmaceutical researcher is evaluating a nuclear enzyme inhibitor for the treatment of an inherited disorder. During an experiment, he extracts and purifies nuclear enzymes from skin cells of an affected patient. One of these enzymes is found to catalyze the methylation of cytosine residues in DNA using S-adenosyl-methionine (SAM) as the methyl donor.\n\nThis enzyme most likely plays a crucial role in which of the following genetic processes?",
